Design a one-bit full adder using dataflow modeling. The module takes three one-bit inputs (a, b, and carry-in cin) and produces a sum output (s), a propagate output (p), and a generate output (g). The sum is calculated as the exclusive OR (XOR) of the three inputs, while the propagate output indicates if either of the inputs can propagate a carry (a XOR b), and the generate output signifies whether a carry is generated from the two input bits (a AND b).
module top_module(
    input a,b,cin,
    output s,p,g
    );

